{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent non-author per-block review receipt, part 1/2. Reviewer: agent:/root/resume_group04. The 23 candidate rows passed semantic preservation, bloat removal, and directive checks; all 17 scoped path blobs in Gerrit merged commit dac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d are byte-identical to reviewed candidate 7b85e6c96f46a4738b67564f3511378ac0369225.\n\nstable_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tfinal_words\treviewer_session\tsemantic_pass\tbloat_pass\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_baseline_arbitration.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_baseline_arbitration.py:L1-L8\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_baseline_arbitration.py:L1-L3\tBinding baselines, rather than previous snapshots, always arbitrate outbound field diffs. These tests preserve the former enabled-flag behavior and cold-start reporting.\tPASS\t78\t23\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_baseline_arbitration.py::block@112\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_baseline_arbitration.py:L112-L122\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_baseline_arbitration.py:L107-L109\tWith a baseline equal to local but Jira edited and prev_jira_fields stale, dry-run must suppress the outbound field. Consulting prev_jira_fields instead would emit it.\tPASS\t93\t25\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_baseline_normalization_heldout.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_baseline_normalization_heldout.py:L1-L5\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_baseline_normalization_heldout.py:L1-L2\tHeld-out oracle: normalized baseline storage must preserve observable reads and outbound mutations.\tPASS\t33\t13\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_link_diff.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_link_diff.py:L1-L16\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_link_diff.py:L1-L3\tThe SupportsLinks port maps vendor links into canonical relations and back to wire payloads. These tests preserve the outbound ADD payload and relation-based comparison.\tPASS\t103\t25\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_link_diff_heldout.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_link_diff_heldout.py:L1-L6\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_link_diff_heldout.py:L1-L2\tHeld-out link-edge oracle: deduplicate either direction, skip unmapped relations, ignore unknown remote types, and swap depends_on direction.\tPASS\t36\t19\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_outbound_equivalence.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_outbound_equivalence.py:L1-L12\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_outbound_equivalence.py:L1-L3\tOutbound field comparison uses the injected inbound mapper to canonicalize remote state, then maps emitted updates back through the outbound mapper. These tests preserve exact pre-refactor mutations and mapper injection.\tPASS\t111\t31\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_outbound_equivalence_heldout.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_outbound_equivalence_heldout.py:L1-L7\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_outbound_equivalence_heldout.py:L1-L2\tHeld-out equivalence oracle for both-empty and permissive assignee identities, plus partial baseline field-presence semantics.\tPASS\t46\t17\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_comment_dedup_key_matches_send_fit.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_comment_dedup_key_matches_send_fit.py:L1-L30\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_comment_dedup_key_matches_send_fit.py:L1-L3\tCloud comment dedup must use the same serialized-ADF fit and marker budget as sending. The equality skip is the fallback when comment-ID recording fails; divergent fits would repost long comments on every pass.\tPASS\t248\t35\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_comment_dedup_key_matches_send_fit.py::block@115\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_comment_dedup_key_matches_send_fit.py:L115-L125\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_comment_dedup_key_matches_send_fit.py:L88-L90\tCompare the differ key with a body captured from the real send path under plain and rich cutover. Independent derivation on each side detects drift in either fit.\tPASS\t105\t28\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_assignee_permissive.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_assignee_permissive.py:L1-L14\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_assignee_permissive.py:L1-L2\tA local assignee may match Jira emailAddress, accountId, or displayName. Comparing displayName alone caused repeated outbound updates for equivalent identities.\tPASS\t118\t20\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_assignee_unmappable_converges.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_assignee_unmappable_converges.py:L1-L14\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_assignee_unmappable_converges.py:L1-L3\tAn unresolvable local assignee means desired unassigned; an already-unassigned Jira issue must converge without repeated updates. Resolvable users still sync, and the no-resolver path keeps permissive matching.\tPASS\t125\t29\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_comments_adf.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_comments_adf.py:L1-L20\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_comments_adf.py:L1-L3\tJira may return comments as ADF dictionaries while local bodies are strings. Normalize both to text before hashing and comparison to avoid crashes and duplicate outbound comments.\tPASS\t152\t27\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_comments_codec_normalization.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_comments_codec_normalization.py:L1-L28\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_comments_codec_normalization.py:L1-L3\tThe outbound comment dedup key must match the rich-text codec's send/round-trip form. These tests use a non-identity AdfCodec transform that earlier symmetric-normalization fixtures could not detect.\tPASS\t229\t32\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_comments_codec_normalization.py::block@122\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_comments_codec_normalization.py:L122-L131\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_diff_comments_codec_normalization.py:L97-L98\tWithout an injected codec, the default Cloud AdfCodec must normalize a sent soft wrap to the Jira-stored form and emit no duplicate comment.\tPASS\t101\t24\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_differ.py::block@383\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_differ.py:L383-L391\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_differ.py:L383-L384\tDeterminism stress covers the mutation pairs emitted by the differ. Downstream  clean_label and repair_property pairs belong to applier tests.\tPASS\t76\t19\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_differ.py::block@486\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_differ.py:L486-L501\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_differ.py:L479-L481\tThe fetch snapshot carries rebar-id labels but no local_id property. Treat a  labeled Jira issue as bound, or the snapshot differ creates a phantom local  ticket and ghost rebar-id label. Bound issues emit no inbound CREATE/conflict.\tPASS\t157\t39\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_archived_status_roundtrip.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_archived_status_roundtrip.py:L1-L9\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_archived_status_roundtrip.py:L1-L2\tA Jira Done echo of an outbound archived/deleted transition must not reopen or close the terminal local ticket; a genuine non-Done move still applies.\tPASS\t81\t26\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_bound_but_absent.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_bound_but_absent.py:L1-L28\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_bound_but_absent.py:L1-L3\tShare the outbound bounded direct GET for alive bound keys absent from search results with inbound diffing. Merge HTTP 200 fields into the inbound snapshot once per pass; never mirror a 404 key.\tPASS\t248\t33\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_comment_snapshot_shape.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_comment_snapshot_shape.py:L1-L17\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_comment_snapshot_shape.py:L1-L3\tInbound comment sync reads the fetched Jira REST shape: a singular comment field containing nested comments and total. A flat comments key would silently miss Jira-origin comments.\tPASS\t136\t28\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS\ntests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_field_contract.py::block@1\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_field_contract.py:L1-L15\tdac8df606ac5d4732a53cc02be976ee856ca209d:tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_field_contract.py:L1-L3\tOutbound field names that differ inbound must map through _OUTBOUND_TO_INBOUND_FIELD. In particular, parent maps to parent_id so inbound echo suppression uses the same key.\tPASS\t98\t24\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\tPASS\tPASS"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792756107684286673,"uuid":"06ff04a8-d6b3-40c5-9836-e71132b28ecf"}